Z||000001||StuGood||03-16-2001||02:53 PM||||Go look at a Chevy Corvair clutch linkage sometime, if you get a chance.  They're amechanical linkage, and it looks pretty Rube Goldberg.  Several points you need to lube and so forth, but the weird thing is - they (well, mine, anyway) are real smooth and light.<P>Could you steal the linkages, bolt them onto a Fiero and expect it to work?? No way - but maybe it'd give you a couple things to link about  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">      ||||reg||3
Z||000002||JohnnyK||03-16-2001||03:25 PM||||No, but I could steal the design, and expect it to work!||||reg||1
