Z||000005||William Federle||03-18-2001||06:27 PM||||I think that 1979 to 1998 Mustangs had mechanical clutch linkages. If you look in the Summit catalog near the back, there is a section on Mustang stuff and there are adjustable clutch quadrants available - it sounds like that is not all that's involved  though. <p>[This message has been edited by William Federle (edited 03-18-2001).]||||reg||1
